\n\nV for b): all \"---\" → null.\n\nTable B common: verification scale interval 0.02 (only 0.02!), everything else same.\n\nAlso table B Q3=6.3 note: revision says R 125 in orientation H and R 40 in orientation any added for b) — consistent with data (R H up to 125, any up to 40).\n\nNow connection dimensions for b) Q3=16 DN50: \"G 2 ½ B or flange\".\n\nLength b): Q3=6.3 DN25: ≥175²⁾; DN32: ≥175¹⁾; 10 DN25: ≥175²⁾; 10 DN32: ≥175²⁾; 16 DN40: ≥270³⁾; 16 DN50: ≥270.\n\nNow assemble everything.\n\nIssuing authority:\nname: \"Physikalisch-Technische Bundesanstalt\"\naddress_lines: [\"Bundesallee 100\", \"38116 Braunschweig\"]\nperson_responsible: \"Dr. Gudrun Wendt\"\nperson_title: \"Head of Department\"\nAlso CIML member: Dr. Roman Schwartz, Head of Division — schema has no field; could add? The issuing_authority schema: name, address_lines[], person_responsible, person_title, phone, email, website, oiml_issuer_id. I'll add nothing extra, or maybe note in description. Skip. Hmm, could include second person under... no field. Skip.\n\nApplicants: [{name: \"ZENNER International GmbH & Co. KG\", address_lines: [\"Römerstadt 6\", \"66121 Saarbrücken\"]}]\n\nManufacturers: 5 entries:\n1. Zenner International GmbH & Co KG. — Talstraße 42, 09619 Mulda, GERMANY\n2. Zenner Meters Ltd — 15 Dongxing Road, Songjiang Industrial Zone, 201613 Shanghai, CHINA\n3. Zenner do Brasil Instrumentos de Medição Ltda. — Rua Bartolomeu de Gusmão, 2.444, Canudos – Nuovo Hamburgo RS, CEP: 93546-000, BRAZIL\n4. ZENNER Coma JVC Construction Machinery Company — 125D Minh Khai, Q Hai Ba Trung, Hanoi, VIETNAM\n5. Zenner Aquamet India Pvt Ltd. — 39-B, HSIDC Industrial Estate, Sec. 31, Faridabad-121003, INDIA\n\ncertified_type:\ncategory: \"Water meter\"\ntype_designations: [\"MTK\", \"MTK-AM\", \"MTK-N\", \"MTK-I\", \"MTK-8R\", \"MTK-CC\", \"MTK-45\", \"MTK-D\"]\n  Page 2: \"Type: MTK-AM, MTK-N, MTK-I, MTK-8R, MTK-CC, MTK-45, MTK-D\". Page 4 says \"Type MTK, MTK-N, MTK-8R, MTK-CC, MTK-45, MTK-D\". MTK 